<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Promus Hotel started neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Promus Hotel started neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co analyst Jason Ader started coverage of Promus Hotel Corp with a neutral rating, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- The Memphis, Tenn., hotel company operates Embassy Suites, Hampton Inn, and Homewood Suites.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed Tuesday on the New York Stock Exchange at 36-3/4.</p>
</text>
